    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Origins"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "We came from companies where the data existed but the answers did not. Brilliant people spending half their week pulling exports, merging spreadsheets, and rebuilding context that should have been instant. The problem was never the data. It was the distance between the data and the person who needed it."
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "We built Strand to close that distance. One graph. Every source. Anyone on the team can ask a question and get an answer in seconds, not days. Two years in, 2,400 teams have made that switch."
    },
    {
